; In our basic Schelling's model (lab2_5.nlogo), unsatisfied agents leave places (patches)
;that do not meet their preferences. Let’s extend that model. Under this new specification,
;agents leaving unhappy places, tell other in-group agents (same color) about these places
;so that they will not move into those places in the future.
